<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 12.0 bln Skr in T-bills Jan 8.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 12.0 bln Skr in T-bills Jan 8.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Thursday it would issue two billion crowns in three month T-bills, three billion crowns of six-month paper and seven billion crowns of one-year bills on January 8.  </p>
<p>The office said bids were due at 1130 GMT on the day of the auction and the result would be presented at 1150 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1017</p>
